してはならない。みんなの助けがあれば、きっとプリンセス·リリスを救出できる。","nextNodeIds":[741002505]},{"nodeId":741002505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20996,"speakerName":"プティ·シュ","textMapHash":2914226242,"text":"そうだね、プリンセス·リリスを救出できれば…","nextNodeIds":[741002506]},{"nodeId":741002506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20997,"speakerName":"アル","textMapHash":98937178,"text":"ああ、そうすれば、水仙十字王国は以前のようにきらきらと輝く姿を取り戻せる。姫はまた君を胸に抱いて、君のために毛繕いをし、小さなおでこをそっと撫でてくれるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[741002507]},{"nodeId":741002507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20997,"speakerName":"アル","textMapHash":654339290,"text":"水辺で失われた思い出は再び戻り、友人たちはみな笑顔で姫の周りを取り囲む。何もかもが幸せで満ち足りて、争いも悩みもなくなるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[741002508]},{"nodeId":741002508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20996,"speakerName":"プティ·シュ","textMapHash":2311227570,"text":"かつてのようにね！","nextNodeIds":[741002509]},{"nodeId":741002509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20997,"speakerName":"アル","textMapHash":1450570818,"text":"…そう、かつてのように。","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7410026,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":true,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":false,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7410003","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_